{"asset_key":"ep7/quest_story_17102440","episode":"ep7","category":"quest_story","story_id":"17102440","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1710244001:0":{"text":"모두 침착하세요!","source_cn":"诸位请保持冷静！不要惊慌！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE4DE789944680BB8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1710244002:1":{"text":"왕자님, 늦었습니다. 부디 용서해 주십시오.","source_cn":"殿下，属下来迟，请您恕罪。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD950B1FCA0816E33","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1710244003:1":{"text":"헨드릭 경, 예를 갖출 필요는 없다. 즉시 현장을 봉쇄하고 질서를 유지하도록!","source_cn":"亨德里克卿，无需多礼。立即封锁现场！维持秩序！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x36BE5ADE2849DF33","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1710244004:1":{"text":"여왕은 오리안의 말에 아랑곳하지 않고, 빠르게 고대의 전당의 입구가 있어야 할 계단 앞으로 달려갔다.","source_cn":"王后没有理会奥利安的调度，而是快步冲到台阶前，那里本该...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCF9DEE7AE12BA807","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1710244005:1":{"text":"페기! 오리안, 페기가 아직 안에 있단다!","source_cn":"佩吉！奥利安！佩吉还在里面！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB75EF3D8248F4F3E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1710244006:1":{"text":"카세디아 역시... 두 사람이 아직 안에 있는데...!","source_cn":"她和科丝蒂都……她们都还在里面！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD7D349A5DB39CEC4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1710244007:1":{"text":"어머니, 진정하십시오!","source_cn":"母后，请您务必先冷静！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x79188EBA12EC1E21","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1710244008:0":{"text":"헨드릭 경!","source_cn":"亨德里克卿！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x042FC41255E00578","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1710244009:0":{"text":"왕자님, 부르셨습니까.","source_cn":"殿下，属下在。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x34FA94BB1C0B9F55","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1710244010:1":{"text":"즉시 조사를 시작하여, 사라진 고대의 전당을 찾아 반드시 페기를 구출하도록!","source_cn":"我命你立即展开调查，务必找回消失的圣古堂，救出佩吉公主。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0B90841319327D83","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1710244011:0":{"text":"오리안! 잠깐...!","source_cn":"奥利安！等等——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7786D24995975409","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1710244012:0":{"text":"여왕은 앞으로 나아가 손을 뻗어 공기 중에 남은 마력 파동을 감지했다.","source_cn":"王后走上前，伸出手，感知着空气中残留的魔力波动。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC9C21BF76CE6E5CA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1710244013:0":{"text":"마력의 흔적이... 거칠고 원시적이구나... 분명 대규모 마법일 테니, 일반적인 조사로는 해결할 수 없겠어.","source_cn":"这种魔力残留……粗暴又原始……这是大规模的魔法，不是常...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x62995CDA69A1DDA0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1710244014:1":{"text":"헨드릭 경, 전 당신의 능력과 충성심을 믿습니다.","source_cn":"亨德里克卿，我相信你的能力和忠诚。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0700A449EF3AA76B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1710244015:1":{"text":"하지만 상식을 넘어서는 마법을 상대하려면... 저희도 만반의 준비를 해야겠지요.","source_cn":"但面对超出常规认知的魔法，我们需要最顶尖的力量协助。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x692922EB6C8BDAE0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1710244016:0":{"text":"멀린, 혹시...","source_cn":"梅林阁下，你是否愿意——","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x4BC06053F265DB60","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"멀린, 혹시...","f